<mxfile><diagram id="diff" name="diff"><mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="notes" value="WF-03 Demo scenarios: 19 thay đổi. Xanh lá = thêm · Đỏ = xoá · Vàng cam = đổi; phần còn lại làm mờ.&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Open recommendation → View the proposed booking for the agreed way&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Pick fastest machine → Propose a booking on the earliest free fit machine&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Book slot → Accept the proposed booking&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Add to schedules → Reserve the tester, required locations and machine together&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-03a Main: book the machine that finishes first → DS-03a Booking on the earliest free fit machine ↔ WF-03 main path&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Book slot → Accept the proposed booking&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Add to schedules → Reserve the tester, required locations and machine together&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-03b Assigned tester is absent → DS-03b Assigned tester is absent ↔ WF-03-E1&lt;br&gt;• Xoá activity “Request slot”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Exclude unfit machine → Exclude the overdue machine: no feasible slot before the due date&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-03c Only machine overdue for calibration → DS-03c Only machine uncalibrated ↔ WF-03-E2&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: No booking, test outsourced → Outsourced → WF-05 Outsourced testing&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: Tester → System&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: Tester → System&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: ● initial node “Only machine overdue” → activity “Request slot” → ● initial node “Only machine overdue” → system activity “Exclude the overdue machine: no feasible slot before the due date”&lt;br&gt;• Xoá activity “Request slot” → system activity “Exclude unfit machine”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: notification “✉ Notify tester” → activity “Open recommendation” → notification “✉ Notify tester” → system activity “Propose a booking on the earliest free fit machine”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Open recommendation” → system activity “Pick fastest machine” → system activity “Propose a booking on the earliest free fit machine” → activity “View the proposed booking for the agreed way”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: system activity “Pick fastest machine” → activity “Book slot” → activity “View the proposed booking for the agreed way” → activity “Accept the proposed booking”" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="2420" height="536" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_l" value="Trước" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="564" width="1170" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_r" value="Sau" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="564" width="1170" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l_ds03_lane_tes" value="Tester" style="swimlane;startSize=40;container=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=#F3F4F6;swimlaneFillColor=#ECFEFF;strokeColor=#9CA3AF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="596" width="300" height="1192" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l_ds03_lane_sys" value="System" style="swimlane;startSize=40;container=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=#F3F4F6;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#9CA3AF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="596" width="300" height="1192" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l_ds03_lane_hod" value="Head of department" style="swimlane;startSize=40;container=0;collapsible=0;fillColor=#F3F4F6;swimlaneFillColor=#FAF5FF;strokeColor=#9CA3AF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="596" width="300" height="1192" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="l_as" value